                                "sense_id": "47a656c9-2d6e-3936-a01c-51d6a6464143",
                                "text": "In a couple of years down there I’ll make my pile, see if I don’t; and then I’ll come back and settle down and turn this farm to the crackiest place in the whole state."
                            }
                        ]
